          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            The best cordless circular saw is the 7-1/4-inch brushless model from the platform you already own, paired with a battery big enough to run it. If you are starting from scratch, the DeWalt DCS573 is our pick for most people, the Milwaukee M18 FUEL 2834-20 and Makita XSH06 are just as capable for their owners, and the Ryobi PBLCS300 is the sensible choice on a budget.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Spend what you save on a better blade and a larger battery. Those two purchases change how a cordless saw performs more than the difference between any two saws on this list.
